# Marketing UI

Preserve the established Memli look when editing marketing/auth surfaces.

## Structure

- Marketing shell: `routes/_marketing.tsx` — `Nav` → `main` → `Footer`.
- Shared footer links: `components/site-footer-nav.tsx` (tones: `onLight` / `onDark`).
- Co-locate marketing section components under `routes/_marketing/-components/`.

## Visual direction

- One job per section; avoid card-heavy heroes and cluttered pill/stat strips.
- Brand should read clearly in the first viewport (product name is a hero-level signal, not only tiny nav text).
- Use existing design tokens and Button variants; do not invent a parallel button style.
- Motion: intentional (menu icon morph, sticky bar, subtle reveals) — not decorative noise.

## Auth

- Auth layout uses `BackToHome` and light-tone footer nav; keep parity with marketing brand without duplicating a full marketing nav on auth pages unless requested.
